| **Length Query** | `array.length` | Read-only field (no parentheses). |
| **Access / Update** | `array[index]` | $O(1)$ constant-time random access. |
| **Out-of-Bounds** | Index $< 0$ or $\ge length$ | Throws `ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException`. |

