| Feature | Package | Performance | Type Safety | JPMS Boundary |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Reflection** | `java.lang.reflect` | Moderate (slow if uncached) | Checked at runtime | Blocked unless opened |
